37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, half the plants lose signal for whole afternoons! And visitor approval took six weeks? That’s a huge mystery. I’ll check the incident logs and network coverage.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"My data confirms the friction. We lose an hour daily copying records, and clerks re-request the same certificates. We must fund the fix, not the pitch.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
